<document xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
  <title>Practice Spotting Calculation Errors</title>
  <metadata xmlns:md="http://cnx.rice.edu/mdml">
    <md:content-id>m02450</md:content-id>
    <md:title>Practice Spotting Calculation Errors</md:title>
    <md:uuid>7e1dbda9-4d60-4233-9dce-babfc79c3409</md:uuid>
  </metadata>
  <content>
    <section id="sect-00001"><title>Cool Down</title>
      <exercise id="exer-00001">
        <problem id="prob-00001">
          <para id="para-00001">Here is someone's solution to the equation <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>–</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>20</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math>.</para>
          <para id="para-00002"><emphasis>Step 1</emphasis> - <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>–</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>20</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
          <para id="para-00003"><emphasis>Step 2</emphasis> - <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math>, <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>–</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math>, <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>c</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>20</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
          <para id="para-00004"><emphasis>Step 3</emphasis> - <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mo>–</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mi>±</m:mi><m:msqrt><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>–</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mi>c</m:mi></m:mrow></m:msqrt></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
          <para id="para-00005"><emphasis>Step 4</emphasis> - <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mo>–</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>±</m:mi><m:msqrt><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mo>–</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>–</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>20</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:msqrt></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
          <para id="para-00006"><emphasis>Step 5</emphasis> - <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mo>–</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>±</m:mi><m:msqrt><m:mrow><m:mo>–</m:mo><m:mn>16</m:mn><m:mo>–</m:mo><m:mn>240</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msqrt></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
          <para id="para-00007"><emphasis>Step 6</emphasis> - <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mo>–</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>±</m:mi><m:msqrt><m:mrow><m:mo>–</m:mo><m:mn>256</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msqrt></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
          <para id="para-00008">No Solutions<newline /></para>
          <para id="para-00009">Identify as many errors as you can and briefly explain each error.</para>
          <para id="para-00010"/>
        </problem>
        <solution id="sol-00001">
          <para id="para-00011">Compare your answer: </para>
          <list id="list-00001">
            <item><m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math> is -4, so in Step 4, the value <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mo>–</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math> should be -(-4), which is 4.</item>
            <item>In Step 1, the equation should be rewritten as <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>c</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math>, so the constant term <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>c</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math> is -20, not 20. So, in Step 4, the last part of the numerator should be <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:msqrt><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mo>–</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>–</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mo>–</m:mo><m:mn>20</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:msqrt></m:mrow></m:math>.</item>
            <item>In Step 4, <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mo>–</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> should be 16. Squaring a negative number gives a positive number.</item>
            <item>If the earlier issues were fixed, then the values under the square root symbol would be <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mn>16</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>240</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> or 256.</item>
          </list>
        </solution>
      </exercise>
    </section>
  </content>
</document>